<p>A professional invoice isn't just a payment request — it's a legal document that protects you, your client, and the transaction. Yet most freelancers and small business owners send invoices that are missing key information, which leads to disputes and delayed payment.</p>

<p>This guide covers exactly what to include, how to structure it, and how to get paid faster.</p>

