<h2>Invoice vs Receipt vs Quote: What's the Difference?</h2>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Quote / Estimate:</strong> Sent before work begins — shows what you'll charge</li>
  <li><strong>Invoice:</strong> Sent after work is complete (or on a milestone) — requests payment</li>
  <li><strong>Receipt:</strong> Issued after payment is received — confirms the transaction is settled</li>
</ul>

